section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Y44QbwSpmp05eLhWco2Y8iaEoVqXbnGcSKiatUOJt5lfxkvliaVdqCZQ69cTZiciaSe96OT6KCnUFAdXiaSOOeUicFwTGJhQFNgXLMHm9rWttBbc4Y/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><font><span>根据《重庆大学2027年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）招生预报名公告》，我院现启动2027年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生预报名工作，报名学科涵盖哲学、中国史、中国语言文学三个一级学科，类型包括</span></font></font><font><font><span>学术硕士和学术博士（直博生）。具体如下：</span></font></font></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><font><span>一、报名学科与类型</span></font></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><section><p><b><span>一级学科</span></b></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><b><span>专业代码</span></b></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><b><span>类型</span></b></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>哲学</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>010100</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>学术硕士</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>中国语言文学</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>050100</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>学术硕士、学术博士（直博生）</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>中国史</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>060200</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>学术硕士</span></p></section></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>二、报名条件</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>1.经教育部批准具有推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生资格高校的2027届优秀本科生，手续完备，材料齐全。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2.在校期间政治思想表现好，品德优良，诚实守信，学风端正，身心健康，勤奋好学，遵纪守法，无考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违纪违法受处分处罚记录。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3.思维敏捷，创新意识强，具备综合分析问题和解决问题的能力，学习成绩优秀。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>4.本科阶段学习成绩突出，特别是专业成绩优异，专业排名位居前列，学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较强的创新意识和科研能力。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>5.符合我校当年招生章程和招生专业目录中规定的报考条件。</span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>三、报名流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>（一）提交材料：</span></strong></p><p><span>1.《推免基本信息表》（附件1）、《推免报名表&amp;个人陈述与学术规划》（附件2）；</span></p><p><span>2.大学本科阶段成绩单扫描件（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章）；</span></p><p><span>3.外语水平证明（如CET-4、CET-6、TOEFL、IELTS等的证书或成绩单扫描件）；</span></p><p><span>4.校级及以上获奖证书和公开发表的学术论文等证明自身能力的材料（如有）；</span></p><p><span>5.其他证明材料（如有）。</span></p><p><span>6.特别说明：直博生仅限申请中国语言文学学科，并需提交一份攻读博士学术计划书，计划书应包括选题依据、文献述评、研究内容、研究方法、研究计划、重要参考文献（15-20篇）等，字数不少于5000字。</span></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>（二）系统填报：</span></strong><span>登录“重庆大学研究生招生服务系统”（网址：http://syk.cqu.edu.cn），如实填写各项信息、上传相关报名材料。</span></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>（三）报名截止时间：</span></strong><span>2026年9月6日（周日）24:00，逾期不再受理。</span></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>（四）注意事项：</span></strong></p><p><span>1.报名者必须按要求完成以上程序，并完整、准确提交材料，方为报名成功。</span></p><p><span>2.申请直博生者，须提前取得所报考博士生导师的同意。</span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>四、推免复试安排</span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.我院将组织专家对申请材料进行审核，通过“重庆大学研究生招生服务系统”进行反馈。学生报名后，请随时保持关注，查询审核结果。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2.复试时间及其他相关安排另行通知，请留意系统信息。</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>五、重要提醒</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>凡考核合格且获得所在本科毕业学校推免资格的“推免生”（含“直博生”），均须登录“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（简称“全国推免服务系统”，网址：http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm，开通时间详见中国研招网公告），按要求填报我校相关学院、专业，并完成相关手续，直至系统显示“待录取”状态。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>六、联系方式</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>联系电话：023-65102009（夏老师）</span></p><p><span>邮箱：luciaxia@cqu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>重庆大学人文社会科学高等研究院</span></p><p><span>二〇二六年七月九日</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>附件下载：</span></strong></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/W5ZONcyCXQvCpLJgfQm3zQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1推免基本信息表.xlsx</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/W5ZONcyCXQvCpLJgfQm3zQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2预推免报名表.docx</a></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Y44QbwSpmp30mJhibznic8njUuUyLowmbnjVMtTvpJtXO7orAcMMMq4yK6Q3vOAnqia96mMKkibDcHDPdq0IfaS5ibNfSzpIgGYGHUqMRleEtPD0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><p><span><span>审核 | 夏璐璐、唐杰、张可心</span></span></p><p><span><span>编辑 | 秦仪容</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"34f134df264d1f535ebe8d9ef7df0dd864fb540b67f2fd933fbdb083e7bc912a","textLength":1322,"sourceSha256":"244013e919baf61b1ea0abdf57abd2179f1df00fd4152de8a2214ac7be8c5b75","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e1ea9998723b72163795","title":"2026年重庆大学人文社会科学高等研究院2027年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名工作通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:24.956071+00:00"}
